1
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:03,800
There's only one
day left until GTA

2
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:04,700
6.

3
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:06,880
Almost 10 years
of waiting,

4
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,760
and finally the
moment is here.

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,580
The whole world
is going crazy.

6
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:13,500
People are
buying new PCs,

7
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:14,680
consoles, monitors,

8
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,180
game stores
are packed.

9
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:19,740
The internet is
nothing but GTA 6,

10
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,560
everyone is getting
ready to play.

11
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:23,280
But there's
one problem.

12
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:25,280
I don't have
a powerful PC,

13
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,040
I don't have the
game and I don't have

14
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:27,740
the money.

15
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,660
I look at the screen
and realize tomorrow

16
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:32,660
the whole world
will be playing GTA

17
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:35,100
6 and I'll
be left out.

18
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,320
But suddenly
I get an idea.

19
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,760
If I can't
play GTA 6,

20
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,280
why not make
money from it?

21
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:45,160
I open an AI video
app and start making

22
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:48,340
my own videos in
the style of GTA 6.

23
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:50,940
Video 1, a walk
through the huge city

24
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:51,980
of Vice City.

25
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:55,740
Video 2, a crazy
ride in a sports car.

26
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:58,460
Video 3, what would
happen if I ended

27
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:00,380
up inside GTA 6?

28
00:01:02,380 --> 00:01:03,760
I edit the clips,

29
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:06,060
add music and upload
them to my channel.

30
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:09,360
At first almost
nobody watches,

31
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:10,720
but a few
hours later,

32
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,380
something
incredible happens.

33
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:15,000
My first video
hits 10,000 views.

34
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:16,880
Then 50,000.

35
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:19,340
And then my channel
starts blowing up.

36
00:01:19,700 --> 00:01:22,120
I realize this might
be my only chance

37
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:23,660
to earn enough
for the game.

38
00:01:24,020 --> 00:01:25,540
And then midnight.

39
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:28,500
GTA 6 is
officially out.

40
00:01:29,140 --> 00:01:31,220
The whole world
launches the game and

41
00:01:31,260 --> 00:01:33,300
I'm staring at my
screen watching new

42
00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:34,840
notifications
roll in.

43
00:01:34,940 --> 00:01:36,500
My channel
keeps growing,

44
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:38,200
but will the money
I've made be enough

45
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:40,520
to finally
buy GTA 6?

46
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:43,640
Or will I stay the
guy who makes money

47
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:46,260
from a game he has
never even played?
